docs {
  # Delete ASH Tracking Record
  
  Permanently deletes a single ASH termly tracking record by its unique identifier. The corresponding cache entry is also invalidated.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `delete` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                              |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the termly tracking record       |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Confirmation that the record was deleted.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Ash tracking data deleted successfully"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                        |
  |-----------------------------|----------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).        |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                           |
}
